WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:02.604
Make cover art with AI

2
00:00:03.111 --> 00:00:09.157
Want a picture for your cover? Choose Make artwork with AI.

3
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:19.539
Pick a style, then describe the picture. Ideas suggests some from your book.

4
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:25.992
Drafts are quick and cheap for trying ideas. Print-ready 4K is large enough for a paperback.

5
00:00:25.994 --> 00:00:32.383
The prompt is written for you from your book and your cover colours. Edit it freely.

6
00:00:32.386 --> 00:00:36.017
Pictures use credits, bought as you go from $10. No subscription.
